    "basis": "the accepted reference-learning arrangements of 09-21/22, a part each, promoted through the style's families (`styles/deep-house-parts.ts`), never pinned or drawn alone",
    "note": "Eight soft three-note chords over sixteen bars, long holds and room between them: the approved ringing chord part (09-22), its bed clearing left out so a drone it plays beside is never cut; under a pedal of a bar, each phrase's last chord ringing two bars.",
    "moved": "round keys-room, 10-29 (his ear: \"in Sunrise there is an issue that piano is gone from 0:30 until 1:50\"): the part carries the chords' colour, so it stays: a switch-up that takes it out gives it back a phrase (8 bars) before its section's line, and a breakdown, where a theme sits out, keeps it: over the pad a thinner statement of it, where each phrase starts and where it lands, four chords of eight, each rung as a landing, at 0.8 of its strength; where no pad plays, its whole statement; round keys-moments, 10-29 (his ear on the sketches: \"color in breakdown - great\"): the part may take a long breakdown's last phrase alone, a line of its own notes over its own soft chords (`stays.solo`, `src/keys-moments.ts`), in a share of the themes where it fits"
